window.products.push({"id":1064036,"name":"Air Fryer Liners, Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, Air Fryer Parchment Paper,Oil-proof, Water-proof, Non-stick Air Fryer Liners,Perfect for oven, mic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HjdsvNtjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Keep Your Air Fryer Clean and Durable】Our air fryer disposable paper liner can effectively keep food residue away from fryer and make it as clean as unused, saving time and effort. And, Prolong the service life of air fryer. If you hate cleaning after baking, our air fryer disposable paper liner are your best helper. 【Healthy and Tasty】Our air fryer parchment paper using food grade parchment, air fryer liners are non-sticky, grease-proof, waterproof and heat-resistant. Air fryer disposable paper liner can withstand temperatures up to 446°F (230°C). And the air fryer liner has no effect on the taste of food. Compare with air fryer liners with holes, Our air fryer liners will be no trouble of oil flowing out of the hole and soiling the fryer. 【Easy to Use】The air fryer disposable paper liner is designed with a round bowl shape, which do not need to fold, tear, cut or bend, and you can directly put it in when you are ready to cook. Its heightened edge 1.8 inches can protect the side of fryers and prevent food from sticking to them. And, the heat is generated by air circulation from the pan's wall, and it won't affect the air circulation by using air fryer liners. 【Widely Used】Air fryer parchment paper suitable for air fryer, microwave, oven, steamer, cooker, etc. The air fryer liners can be applied for frying, roasting, baking, or serving food, suitable for home baking, camping, BBQ, summer party, and so on, practical and lightweight. 【Many Choices】There are 6.3 \" and 7.9 \" sizes to choose from. It is recommended to buy 7.9 \" Large size, and the capacity is more in line with the needs of the family and compatible with more air fryers. 【Buying guide】6.3 inches ( bottom wide 6.3 inches) is suitable for 3.7qt air fryer. It is suitable for 2 to 3 people. 7.9 inches (overall can max extend up to 11.42 inches, bottom wide 7.9 inches) is suitable for air fryers of 5.8 quarts and above. It is suitable for 3 to 5 people. Please choose the matching bottom width of the paper liner for your air fryer according to the size of your air fryer basket. 【Attention】Make sure that food are evenly and completely placed on the top of the air fryer liners to avoid air fryer liners flying away or burning by heating elements! Don't put in the air fryer liners when preheating!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HjdsvNtjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KIKTEC","source_asin":"B09XJ61W4Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1064036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XJ61W4Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XJ61W4Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
