window.products.push({"id":1064109,"name":"KESSAKU 8-Inch Chef & 8-Inch Serrated Bread & 5.5-Inch Utility Knife Set - Samurai Series - Forged High Carbon 7Cr17MoV Stainless Steel - Pakkawood Ha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91n+ykgoYtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAMURAI SERIES - Sleek. Gorgeous. Ferociously formidable with unparalleled craftsmanship. Designed by our master artisans, our Samurai Series Knives feature a perfectly balanced & ergonomic grip for amazing comfort & safety. The traditional paring & utility knife has been redesigned with modern refinements to be sleek, fast, aerodynamic, and highly engineered for precision and maneuverability. Visually stylish & sure to draw the eye in any kitchen, this is one great-looking knife. THE BLADE - Relentlessly sharp like a surgeon’s scalpel & made from our specially formulated High Carbon 7CR17MOV Stainless Steel for enhanced corrosion resistance & non-stick properties. These Precision Forged blades are individually handcrafted & hand-sharpened using the traditional 3-stage Honbazuke method by our virtuoso technicians to 16° per side for clean, precise, cuts, amazing edge-retention, and have a Rockwell Hardness of 58 for maximum strength, flexibility, & blade edge durability. WONDROUS COMFORT - When you first grip the handles of these knives it will feel as if they were made specifically for you. Their Mirror-Polished Smooth Pakka Wood handles offer amazingly superior Full Tang (the blade extends far into the handle) strength for a lifetime of safe & precise use. Their seamless build ensures that no dirt or debris can ever infiltrate their pristine body, and are nearly impervious to heat, cold, and moisture. CONSTRUCTED TO LAST FOREVER - These knives will be your culinary companions for life & come with Kessaku’s 100% Lifetime Warranty. Because we work tirelessly to ensure you’re delivered true quality culinary masterpieces, all of our knives come with our Kessaku True Lifetime Warranty. Our very highest priority is that you are completely thrilled with our products & truly in love with our brand. Contact us with any issue or concerns & we will immediately do our absolute best to make it right. MAKES AN AMAZING PRESENT - These exquisite knives will arrive in style, greeting you in our beautifully designed & elegant Magnetic Closure Gift Boxes, Custom Sheaths & Polishing Cloths. Perfect for a Birthday, Wedding, Anniversary, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Christmas, House Warming, etc. Give this to your favorite chef. The astonishing quality of these lovingly crafted, professional knives means you’ll be giving them a gift that they’ll have & use for eternity so they’ll always think of you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91n+ykgoYtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KESSAKU","source_asin":"B0979N9HPC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1064109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0979N9HPC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0979N9HPC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
