window.products.push({"id":1064248,"name":"Kashmir Designs Brown Contemporary Pillow Cover | Geometric Pattern Pillows | Abstract Throw Pillows | Modern Outdoor Pillows | Modern Farmhouse Chair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XEMRVpNzL._AC_.jpg","description":"70% Wool 30% Cotton Handmade in India ❤ PREMIUM GEOMETRIC PATTERN PILLOWS: These unique modern contemporary pattern pillow covers are genuinely hand embroidered in soft wool, stitch by stitch by the finest artisans, creating an extraordinary modern pillow for your home or office. A close-up view of these mid century modern throw pillow cover allows you to see the amazing chain-stitch hand embroidery work done by the master artisans . Pillow insert not Included (Only Cover is on Sale). ❤ REFRESH YOUR HOME OR OFFICE DECOR: These unique hand embroidered abstract Contemporary Waves pillow covers would bring together the artistic elements of any room, creating a harmonious design, perfect air of sophistication. Pillow insert not Included (Only Cover is on Sale), Zipper closure on back. Pillow Cover Size: 18\"x18\" (45cm x 45cm) Approx. Pillow Cover is not Reversible, Backing: Canvas (See additional Pictures). The whole front of this pillow cover is covered with hand embroidery. ❤ BE UNIQUE! ADD ONE OF A KIND PILLOW TO YOUR DECOR: These premium quality musical pillow covers are created by using musical modern art designs and translating them into pillow covers using traditional hand embroidery. This soft handcrafted modern throw pillow will liven up a transitional or modern style home or office. Design Inspired by the works of world famous Artist, Alfred Gockel. These fabulous eye-popping mid century modern pillows can be used virtually anywhere to spice up your decor. ❤ PREMIUM QUALITY - GENEUINE ALL OVER HAND EMBROIDERY: Our Tribal Kilim wool pillow covers are made of premium organic natural materials - 70% soft wool and 30% cotton. Front Hand embroidery: 100% Soft Wool, Backing: 100% Cotton Canvas. This needlework decorative pillow cover is a work of art, hand crafted to perfection. Our unique Tribal wool pillow case are truly hand embroidered, breathable, soft and comfortable, and easy to care. ❤ LIVEN & BRIGHTEN UP YOUR SPACE: Choose these pillow covers to decor your home, you will win a lot of compliments from your families and friends. These hand embroidered Tribal pillow covers will be the perfect addition to decorate your couch, sofa, bed, chair, loveseat, living room, bed room, floor, porch, outdoors, bench, office etc. Soft to the touch and crisply bright and bold to the eye, these decorative Tribal wool pillows can be used with virtually any type of furnishings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XEMRVpNzL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kashmir Designs","source_asin":"B08SBHP81Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1064248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SBHP81Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SBHP81Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
