window.products.push({"id":1064255,"name":"DHP Bed, Full Size Frame, Metal/White Desk Loft,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31gIPYz9hKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Ideal for studying or creating extra space for your child to play, the DHP metal Loft bed with desk provides the perfect small space solution to maximize your child’s bedroom! Built with a strong metal frame that includes secured metal slats, an integrated ladder, full-length guardrails and a full-length desk underneath the Loft bed, The DHP metal Loft bed with desk is here for the long run. The metal slats also provide mattress support and breathability to help keep you mattress fresher longer. The DHP metal Loft bed with desk is designed to accommodate a standard full size mattress with a thickness that is greater than 4” and does not exceed 6”. The mattress is sold separately. No additional box spring or foundation is required. Available in twin and full size. Offered in a variety of color combinations to give you an option that best suits your child’s bedroom needs!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31gIPYz9hKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DHP","source_asin":"B07WGRZ9JZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1064255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WGRZ9JZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WGRZ9JZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1064256,"name":"Takane Clock Movement with Hands is Complete and Ready to Install (Pkg/1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ryKK5KrpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ideal for the crafter or as a replacement clockworks in many clocks today, this reliable quartz mechanism, made by Takane, is simple to install. This kit included stamped metal classic style black hands. Hour hand is 1\"L and minute hand 1-3/8\"L.. The threaded mounting shaft measures 7/16 inches long and, because of the addition of hardware when you mount it, will require that the thickness of your clock case be no more than 5/16 inches. The diameter of the shaft is 5/16 inches and will require a slightly larger hole in your clock case so the shaft will slide through. Everything is included in this package: the clock, a pair of hands (see image) mounting hardware and hanger. The movement takes an AA battery (not included) and will run for over a year without attention. There is an on-off switch on the back and a simple time- setting wheel. The movement measures a compact 2-1/8 inches square and the sturdy plastic case, not including the shaft, is only 9/16 inches thick. For replacement purposes, if you are reusing your old clock hands please note that the minute hand should be no longer than 6 inches. Illustrated installation instructions are included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ryKK5KrpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Takane","source_asin":"B00PB9E55G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1064256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PB9E55G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PB9E55G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
