window.products.push({"id":1064325,"name":"Toilet Plungers，Piston Clog Remover Clogging Plungers & Holders Unclog Fast Easily Insert Deeper into Pipe Perfect Dredging Tool for Clogged Siphon To","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BDncTWGvL._AC_.jpg","description":"The unique plunger is a magic unclogging tool for clogged toilets. Just by a couple of plunges you can unclog your toilet without running the risk of scratching the ceramic and messing up. You don't have to be strong, just slowly pull back after 10 or more strokes, water will go down quickly. It is fast, easy and can save your call for a plumber visit. You will find this tool a good substitute for a plumber service. NOTE : 1. Keeping the handle low is the key.  2. Don't pull the plunger out of the bowl suddenly, or you will splash yourself. Specification :  Material: Stainless steel, Natural ABS, TPR  Type of Toilet: Siphon-Type Toilet Package Included 1x Toilet Plunger  1x Wall Hook  1x Product Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BDncTWGvL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coolview","source_asin":"B074G2CDRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1064325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074G2CDRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074G2CDRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
