window.products.push({"id":1064439,"name":"Mr. Kate Effie Nightstand, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":90.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Yt6Z3sSQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set the tone for the quintessential bedroom oasis with the unapologetically stunning Effie collection by Mr. Kate. We are entirely convinced you can never go wrong with neutrals and soft color palettes when serenity is the desired result. And let’s face it, we could all use a little more tranquility in our lives. With her calming hues of gray, white & pale pink, Effie lures you in with her charm and entices you to unwind after a long day. A large jewel-shaped drawer with cushion cut drawer front, embellished with a gold accented Lucite drawer pull, offers the ideal bedside compartment for all your evening essentials. The Effie Nightstand is crafted from ultra-durable painted MDF, with a gold powder coated metal frame and finished on all sides for versatility. The fun doesn’t have to end in the bedroom. Place the Effie Nightstand in an entryway or living room to use as an attractive side table. Add the Effie Upholstered Accent Chair and Effie 6 Drawer Wide Dresser to your bedroom ensemble to amplify the peaceful vibes. Perfect for your aesthetic: Vintage Eclectic, Quirky/Whimsical, Glam. Not sure how to define your style? Take the Mr. Kate “What’s My Aesthetic?” Quiz!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Yt6Z3sSQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr. Kate","source_asin":"B0BLG95LJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1064439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLG95LJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLG95LJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
