window.products.push({"id":1064461,"name":"Artechworks Velvet Comfortable Pushback Recliner Chair for Bedroom & Living Room - Single Reclining Sofa with Footrest- Home Theater Seating - Arm Cha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zgRfSzbyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMFORTABLE & STURDY: Upholstered in a soft Velvet that brings a wonderful contrast with the naturally finished solid wood turned feet. With overstuffed padding in divided backrests, the chair has more support and comfort for your lumbar and body. Generous Sizing: Measure 30.31\"W x 35.83\"D x 38.19\"H, Expanded Length – \", Seat Height - 18.9\", Seat Dimensions - 19.69\"W x 21.65\"D, Arms Height – 24.41”, Weight Capacity - 300 lbs SMOOTH OPERATION & HANDS FREE: Reclining mechanism allows you adjust your position effortlessly from upright sitting to a full-extension recline, just push on arms and lean against the back of the recliner, without needing to use your hands to find the lever. Good Living Room Piece: Fully upholstered chair pad comfortably supports your back and legs, suitable for reading books, watching TV shows & films and relaxing at home. EASY ASSEMBLY & GOOD CUSTOMER: Very easy assembly, all parts and instruction included, no screw needed. Professional Customer Service & Technical Support. Contact us freely if have any question.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zgRfSzbyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artechworks","source_asin":"B07ZFG7Q5P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1064461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZFG7Q5P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZFG7Q5P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1064462,"name":"Shun Electric Knife Sharpener.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51998OI6xiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For practically effortless sharpening of your Shun cutlery, this Electric Sharpener is made to meet the standards of the Asian knife industry. It runs on 120 volts and uses a removable grindstone cartridge set at a 16-degree angle with a combination of coarse and fine grits. To restore your blade to its factory-sharp edge, pull your knife slowly through the channel lightly just a couple of times. Rinse the grindstone under water to clean and dry thoroughly. Shun knives will continue to offer precision performance when sharpened on a regular basis. Made in the ancient city of Seki, Japan, Shun knives rely on extremely sharp blades, made of Japanese VG10 steel clad with 32 layers (16 on each side) of a proprietary blend of high-carbon stainless pounded so thin, it delivers precision slicing, cutting and chopping that is unprecedented by any of its German competitors. Imagine, a knife made the same way as ancient Samurai swords, handcrafted still today. Sharper out of the box than other knives, the Shun cutlery maintains its sharpness longer, since the finely-polished blade edge has a natural tendency to remain straighter, yet when required, it can be honed using a standard steel or sent to the factory for free sharpening. The wavy, Damascus-look pattern on the blade creates minute air pockets that offer stick resistance, so food releases easier and prep time is reduced--plus it's rust-free. The Shun Steel line features an attractive stainless steel handle, formed in the same \"D\" shape as the Classic knives, for comfort and control. The seamless construction provides a sleek look while also being dishwasher safe and NSF approved for commercial kitchens. Shun Steel knives are suited for right-handed users only..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51998OI6xiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shun","source_asin":"B000CSXOH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1064462","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000CSXOH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000CSXOH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
