window.products.push({"id":1064740,"name":"OHEMDI 4 Pack Wardrobe Clothes Organizer and Storage for Bedroom for Folded Clothes (Grey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bw-VdzwPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1: Here is a personal experience to share with you. I consider my self a person who likes to organize clothes and keep tidy. But as time went by and I had more clothes, the wardrobe at home was a mess. Therefore, I wondered if I could make a clothing storage box to collect and organize clothes. Since then, I began to produce clothing storage box business. Since I used the clothes organizers, the house has become very neat. 2: OHEMDI provides with only the highest quality and best ingredients for clothes storage containers. We have formed a mature quality control system from raw material to finished products and only those who pass the test can become our cooperative suppliers. 3: To us, the clothes organizer isn’t just goods in our life. The closet & drawer organizer more play an role as an assistant to help me create a better living environment. Because of multiple compartments, the clothes organizer can greatly save more space and time to storage our T-shirts, pants, bra, socks, underwear, leggings, jeans and other items. Lightweight and oxford edging design can allow us to put them in drawers and wardrobes. 4: To meet different needs of customers, we are devoted to provide multiple options for Customers. There are 3 different mesh Nylon layers in 7, 9 & 11 grids and 4 sizes of clothing Organizer. We will not stop to pursue better quality and more style design. 5: OHEMDI are dedicated to provide a perfect and greater online shopping experience for you. Your approval is our greatest wealth. If there is any manufacturing defects or damages, please don’t hesitate to contact us via our storefront or send email to us, we will respond within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bw-VdzwPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OHEMDI","source_asin":"B09WGKJKT9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1064740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WGKJKT9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WGKJKT9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1064741,"name":"Wren Bird 2 Lomonosov Porcelain Collectible Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f2ngmoVDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Welcome to the world of Lomonosov Russian Porcelain !  The Imperial Russian Lomonosov Porcelain Manufactory was founded by Empress Elizabeth, Peter the Great's daughter, in 1744. Here the gifted Russian scientist Dmitry Vinogradov independently discovered the secret of making Russian porcelain and developed the technology for its manufacture and the later creation of Lomonosov Russia.  Three hundred years ago no one in Europe had any idea of the materials and techniques used in making porcelain. The Chinese kept the secrets of porcelain production. Only in the early 18th century in Saxony the alchemist Johan F. Bottger discovered a way to produce \"European\" hard paste porcelain. These developments did not escape the notice of Peter I. During his frequent visits to European countries, Peter I pursued his interest in the secrets of porcelain manufacture and he attempted to introduce it to Russia with the help of foreigners, but unsuccessfully. Peter I's idea to establish his own porcelain production was brought to life two decades later by his daughter, who was then Empress Elizabeth (1741-1761).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f2ngmoVDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lomonosov Russia","source_asin":"B0064W0YRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1064741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0064W0YRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0064W0YRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
