window.products.push({"id":1064947,"name":"Inofia Memory Foam Mattress 10 Inch Ergonomic Divided Zoned Bed 2 in 1 Flippable Firmness Mattress in a Box (3“ Twin)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qan1c75wL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Memory Foam FLIPPABLE FOR ALL SLEEPERS - The Inofia mattress comes in both firm and soft feel in one mattress. Choose the firmness that’s suits you today, tomorrow and forever. The multi-zone ergonomic design provides incredible targeted support. Designed to rest on any surface: on the floor, slatted base, box spring or foundation. SOFT AND FIRM IN ONE - The soft side offers a plush hugging feel combined with reactive support for your pressure points for side sleepers. Back sleepers and stomach sleepers will enjoy the firm side with increased support and less sink. Flip it to the side that feels best for you. ZONE DIVIDED FOAM SYSTEM - The whole memory foam mattress is divided into modules for precision-engineered support and alignment for each area of your body. Not only supporting your body evenly, keeping your spine aligned throughout the night, but also minimizing motion transfer from your partner. STAY COMFORTABLE IN BED – With up to 450g of super soft knitted craft, our sleep surface gives your mattress an airy lightness that protects and comforts. All our materials are certified by the label Textiles Trust according to OEKO-Tex Standard 100. The breathable cover can be removed and washed under 60 degrees in the gentle cycle. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE - The mattress is compressed and smartly shipped in a box for convenient delivery. Simply take the mattress out of the box, remove the plastic, and give it 24-72 hours to expand to its full size. A 100-Night Sleep Trial for customer to find the most comfortable sleep style with the mattress.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qan1c75wL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inofia","source_asin":"B081D3DP7J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1064947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081D3DP7J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081D3DP7J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
